<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche Morgan starts cellular cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche Morgan starts cellular cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of CommNet Cellular Inc with a buy rating and set a 1997 year-end price target of $35 a share.</p>
<p>-- the stock gained 5/8 to 28-3/8.</p>
<p>-- said it initiated coverage of Rural Cellular Corp with a buy rating and set a 1997 year-end price target of $14 a share.</p>
<p>-- the stock gained 1/2 to 10-1/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
